# The cube inside Sailren's nest (GrandBossTeleporter): its page link (a talk with the cube, onTalk) sends the
# character to one of the three points outside the nest, up to 100 away from it on each axis (every draw 1: the
# second point). The reference probe replays the trip.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/grand_boss_teleporter_sailren_exit.golden
character Pilgrim 60
random always 1
script script.teleport.GrandBossTeleporter
page default/32107.htm
npc cube 32107 Folk 10 0 0

action cube
action cube
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=cube item=0 page=default/32107.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{cube}_Quest GrandBossTeleporter
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=10703,-24041,-3673+-100 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=cube
  S ActionFailed
